## Do not

- Don’t edit the `shadcn/components/ui/` original during conversion.
- Don’t invent parallel token names when an existing `--*` / utility already covers it.
- Don’t change `:root` / `.dark` token meaning just to match one shadcn class — map the class instead.
- Don’t migrate call sites or delete old controls unless the human asks.
